===Clearing the stage without stealing mons===
If the player is too kind to steal a Pokémon from others, which should not be the case when they is playing on the team rocket side, that they does not obtain the Igglyran, there does exist a way to clear the stage with native Pokémons only.

Yet none of the first catch-able Pokémons seem to be able to learn the move rock smash, there is one exception. After leveling up a Cleffa to lv.15 and evolving them to a Clefairy, they will acquire the ability to learn rock smash. The player could speed up this process by fusing two Cleffas together to gain an exp boost.

The next challenge is TM01 cut. The only catch-able mon on the Pinkan island that is able to learn cut is Lickitung, thus the player has first to dive into the forest to catch it and then turn back to cut all the trees down.


